  "scheduling_policy": {
    "original_tree": "Postorder; each original leaf consumes its original count exactly once.",
    "normalization": "Stable page/allocation-order list; one split per page per pass; new-left appended and visited in the same pass; retained-right revisits next pass. Logical order is separate.",
    "root": "Initial allocation RIGHT then LEFT. Grown leaf root has all-but-last bounds/right-tail; grown internal root has bounded children/tail0.",
    "origin": "Original page retains original prefix/framing/residue authority. Appended page remains Fresh seed0/zero unused final bytes even if split repeatedly.",
    "scope": "New multi-offender ordering is declared engineering policy, not a claim of general public/native parity; old odd floor partition unchanged."
  },
  "independent_proof_controls": [
    "Six whole-image contract functions cover repeated root/nonroot/internal-parent, physical owners/aliases/NULL/fullROW, initial/late future cells, all pools and near-final cancellation/retry.",
    "Author1600 MIN/MAX fixture distinguishes same-pass new-left order [4,3,1,2,5,0] from snapshot-pass alternatives.",
    "Private altered padding, future map bit and correlated leaf/root/link permutation first pass ordinary complete table/index/constraint checks, then fail independent final certification with Preservation.",
    "Existing Int32 complete images and borrowed request/order boundary remain checked.",
    "Exact old600/MAX source and count unchanged; now compared to independent repeated fullimage, while same-source exact1 positive retained.",
    "Audit-owned measurement drives every topology decision; permanent unnecessary-growth control and temporary before101/after0 builder-capacity fault probe distinguish certification from shared capacity answers."
